{"id":"n60518-1-8","stage":2,"title":"빈자리 · 空位子","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60518-1-8-1","ko":"아무 자리에나 앉아도 되나요?","zh":"我可以随便坐哪儿吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리에나","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉아도","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/45bcc7bb862da3c88258.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60518-1-8-2","ko":"네, 빈자리 아무데나 편하신 자리로 앉으세요.","zh":"可以，随便选个空位，坐您觉得舒服的地方吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빈자리","meaning":"空位子，空座位","explanation":"빈자리：空位子，空座位","readings":[{"term":"빈자리","audio":"/audio/fbf9af1d0bf0eb20c844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60518","senseId":"1","lemma":"빈자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무데나","meaning":"任何，什么；处所，地方。","explanation":"아무：任何，什么；데：处所，地方。；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"},{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"1","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편하신","meaning":"舒服，舒畅","explanation":"편하다：舒服，舒畅；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"1","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리로","meaning":"座位，席位","explanation":"자리：座位，席位；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"3","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앉으세요.","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fbf9af1d0bf0eb20","term":"빈자리","zh":"空位子，空座位","audio":"/audio/fbf9af1d0bf0eb20c844.mp3","entryId":"60518","definition":"没有人坐的空位置。","pronunciation":["빈ː자리"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"处所，地方。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"处所，地方。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"舒服，舒畅","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"身体或心情不难受，好。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"座位，席位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"供人坐的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"17e77d3fb6b2dbdb","term":"앉다","zh":"坐","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3","entryId":"71463","definition":"挺直上半身，将臀部置于别的物体或地上以支持身体的重量。","pronunciation":["안따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a430f026ef1ebb2d77c6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.496,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60518","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3227,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["可以，随便选个空位，坐您觉得舒服的地方吧。","我和他真的没有任何关系啊。","我可以随便坐哪儿吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["可以，随便选个空位，坐您觉得舒服的地方吧。","我可以随便坐哪儿吗？","我和他真的没有任何关系啊。"],"answer":0}]}
